".SUBCKT SQJ459EP D G S \n"
"M1 3 GX S S PMOS W= 6331157u L= 0.30u \n"
"M2 S GX S D NMOS W= 6331157u L= 0.59u \n"
"R1 D 3 1.365e-02 TC=5.552e-03,1.043e-05\n"
