"CGD GX D 6.266e-11 \n"
"RG G GY 1m \n"
"RTCV 100 S 1e6 TC=6.518e-04,1.655e-07\n"
"ETCV GY GX 100 200 1 \n"
"ITCV S 100 1u \n"
"VTCV 200 S 1 \n"
"DBD D S DBD 6331157u \n"
".MODEL PMOS PMOS ( LEVEL = 3 TOX = 5e-8   RS = 0 KP = 2.403e-06 NSUB = 2.497e"
"+16   KAPPA = 7.849e-04 NFS = 4.380e+11   LD = 0 IS = 0 TPG = -1    )\n"
